  "descriptions": {
    "preferred": "Acer circinatum 'Kisetsu dore' Rare Vine Maple Hybrid Japanese Maple Zones 6-9 'Kisetsu dore' is a Japanese maple hybrid with bright orange-pink new growth in the spring. 'Kisetsu dore' turns green during the summer, turning to bright yellow to orange in autumn. 'Kisetsu dore' may reach 8-10 ft in height and width in 10 years. 'Kisetsu dore' was found and introduced by World Plants shortly before they retired."
  },
